  "not_switched": "this is a shadow measurement. the deployed rule is unchanged until the flips are reviewed against the human-ratified probes, because moving rows to REVIEW is a behaviour change and must be ratified rather than assumed to be an improvement",
  "next_gate": "re-run the ratified scoreboard under the candidate rule and compare steering resistance and paraphrase recall; REGRESSED must be zero, exactly as the ratification invariant requires",
